  },
  "tabs_autoFreezeExplanation": "Freezes this container once none of its tabs has been used for the time you choose. Only time while WebLibre is open counts. Freezing unloads its tabs and stops what it runs in the background, notifications included, until you resume it. It waits while one of its tabs plays media, is in a call, holds a download, or is set to \"Keep awake\". Typed text keeps it waiting until it has been unused for an hour; the text may then be lost.",
  "@tabs_autoFreezeExplanation": {
    "description": "Text at the top of the 'Freeze Automatically' dialog: what the choice does, that only time while WebLibre is open counts, what freezing stops, what keeps the container from freezing, and that typed form text only delays it (for an hour of no use, or the chosen time if longer) and may then be lost. \"Keep awake\" is the tab menu action of the same name."
  },

